    "description": "122-124 College Avenue is a charming duplex with city views, located in San Francisco's desirable  Bernal Heights neighborhood. The building consists of a two-bedroom upper unit and a three-bedroom  lower unit, both currently tenant-occupied with steady rents. The property features a large  basement, offering ample storage or potential for future expansion, and sits on a deep lot with a  spacious backyard, perfect for outdoor living. Whether for an investor or owner-occupier, this duplex presents an excellent opportunity to invest in a property with strong long-term potential.  Ideally located in Bernal Heights, a neighborhood known for its residential charm and close-knit  community, the property offers easy access to both the 101 and 280 freeways, making commuting to Silicon Valley convenient. The nearby Glen Park BART station provides quick access to downtown San Francisco and the East Bay. With its proximity to restaurants, shops, parks, and excellent public  transportation, this location offers the best of both city and suburban lifestyles."
